#: source/release-notes/rl-2.5.md:1
msgid "Release 2.5 (2021-12-13)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.5.md:3
msgid ""
"The garbage collector no longer blocks new builds, so the message `waiting "
"for the big garbage collector lock...` is a thing of the past."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.5.md:7
msgid "Binary cache stores now have a setting `compression-level`."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.5.md:9
msgid "`nix develop` now has a flag `--unpack` to run `unpackPhase`."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.5.md:11
msgid "Lists can now be compared lexicographically using the `<` operator."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.5.md:13
msgid ""
"New built-in function: `builtins.groupBy`, with the same functionality as "
"Nixpkgs' `lib.groupBy`, but faster."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.5.md:16
msgid "`nix repl` now has a `:log` command."
msgstr ""
